      "order": 0,
      "content": "<div class=\"mm-release-marker\" data-mm-release=\"f94027611ab71565c9dfd689046bb4a24db921b97ef1453416d5acfa140ed605\" data-mm-topic=\"t-mm-01-023\" hidden></div>\n<h2 class=\"mm-heading mm-h2 mm-header-banner\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1882]\" style=\"background-color: #2F5496; color: #FFFFFF; padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 4px; font-weight: 700; margin-top: 8pt; margin-bottom: 4pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: #FFFFFF; font-family: \"Calibri Light\", sans-serif; font-size: 16pt'><strong>2</strong></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: #FFFFFF; font-family: \"Calibri Light\", sans-serif; font-size: 16pt'><strong>2</strong></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: #FFFFFF; font-family: \"Calibri Light\", sans-serif; font-size: 16pt'><strong>. HMB IN ADOLESCENCE:</strong></span></h2>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1883]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u2022</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Incidence is </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>4.8 \u2013 37% depending upon definition, geographical location and socioeconomic status.</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1884]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u2022</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Adolescent cycles </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>last</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> between 2 \u2013 7days and occurs every 21 \u2013 25days.</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1885]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u2022</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>50% cycle anovulatory in 1</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><sup>st</sup></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> year.</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1886]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u2022</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>25% cycle anovulatory at 2 \u2013 3year.</span></span></div>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1887]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><strong>Pathological causes:</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1888]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u21e8</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Bleeding disorders:</span></span></div>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1889]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><em><strong>Consider if:</strong></em></span></p>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1890]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 54pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">1.</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>HMB from onset of menarche</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1891]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 54pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">2.</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Recurrent epistaxis.</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1892]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 54pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">3.</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Excessive brushing.</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1893]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 54pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">4.</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Prolong bleeding after injury</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1894]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 54pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">5.</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Fail to respond to conventional therapy.</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1895]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">1.</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><u><strong>VWD:</strong></u></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> most common bleeding disorder in UK.</span></span></div>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1896]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><em><strong>Type I:</strong></em></span></p>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1897]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 72pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">-</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Most common type</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1898]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 72pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">-</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Milder</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1899]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 72pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">-</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Quantitative deficiency of VW factor.</span></span></div>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1900]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><em><strong>Type II:</strong></em></span></p>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1901]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 72pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">-</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Qualitative defects</span></span></div>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1902]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><em><strong>Type III:</strong></em></span></p>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1903]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 72pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">-</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Severe form.</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1904]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 72pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">-</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Association with stress.</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1905]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">2.</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><u><strong>ITP:</strong></u></span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1906]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 72pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">-</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Most common platelet disorder in adolescence</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1907]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 72pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">-</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>7% present with HMB</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1908]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 72pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">-</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Diagnosis on blood film</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1909]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">3.</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><u><strong>Inher</strong></u></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><u><strong>ited Factor</strong></u></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><u><strong> </strong></u></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Malgun Gothic Semilight\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><u><strong>\u2178</strong></u></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><u><strong> and VIII</strong></u></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><u><strong>:</strong></u></span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1910]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 72pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">-</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Consider in HMB in adolescence </span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1911]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 72pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">-</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Family history can be suggestive.</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1912]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">4.</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><u><strong>Endocrinopathies:</strong></u></span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1913]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">1.</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><em><strong>Thyroid Disease:</strong></em></span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1914]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 72pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">-</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Hypothyroid important cause of HMB.</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1915]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 72pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">-</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Symptoms of Hypothyroid + Heavy or irregular bleeding.</span></span></div>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1916]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 72pt\">\u00a0</p>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1917]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">2.</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><em><strong>PCOS:</strong></em></span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1918]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 54pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">-</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Diagnosis is challenging because irregular cycles, hyperandrogenism and multi \u2013 Follicular ovaries are common in adolescence</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1919]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u21e8</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><u><strong>Connective Tissue disorders:</strong></u></span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1920]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 54pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">1.</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Ehle</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>r </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Danlos Syndrome</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1921]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 54pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">2.</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Childhood onset SLE.</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1922]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u21e8</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><u><strong>Endometriosis:</strong></u></span></span></div>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1923]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 54pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Suspect when HMB is associated with dysmenorrhea and pelvic pain.</span></p>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1924]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u21e8</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><u><strong>Chronic systemic discase:</strong></u></span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1925]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 54pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">1.</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Type I DM \u2013 treat HMB by optimizing Glucose levels.</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1926]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 54pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">2.</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Epilepsy:</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1927]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 90pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u2022</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Antiepileptic drugs cause HMB or irregular bleeding.</span></span></div>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1928]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 90pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Sodium valproate, carbamazepine, oxcarbazepine, lamotrigine.</span></p>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1929]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 90pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u2022</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Enzyme inducers reduce efficiency of COCP &amp; progesterone </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Carbamazepine,</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> Phenytoin, </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>phenobarbital</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> rifampicin and high dose topiramate &gt; 200mg/ D </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>&gt;&gt;</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Mirena or DMPA is suggested for those girls taking enzyme inducers.</span></span></div>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1930]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><u><strong>Evaluation of Adolescent HMB:</strong></u></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1931]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><strong>History:</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1932]\" style=\"padding-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u2022</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Age of menarche</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1933]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u2022</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Cycle length and regularity</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1934]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u2022</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Amount of blood loss.</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1935]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u2022</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Impact on quality of life</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1936]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u2022</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Associated symptoms</span></span></div>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1937]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 54pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: #2F5496; font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>dysmenorrhea, dyschezia, bowel symptoms, wt changes, hirsutism, epistaxis, Bruising. </span></p>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1938]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u2022</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Sexual history</span></span></div>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1939]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 54pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: #2F5496; font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Risk of pregnancy, STI, </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: #2F5496; font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>contraception</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: #2F5496; font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: #2F5496; font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>(</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: #2F5496; font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>age</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: #2F5496; font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> of partner and </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: #2F5496; font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>consent</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: #2F5496; font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> if active before age 15).</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1940]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 54pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: #2F5496; font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Address safe guarding issues.</span></p>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1941]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u2022</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Medical history</span></span></div>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1942]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 54pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: #2F5496; font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Bleeding disorders, any systemic disease.</span></p>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1943]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u2022</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Family history</span></span></div>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1944]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 54pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: #2F5496; font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Bleeding disorders, any systemic disease</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1945]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 54pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: #2F5496; font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>VTE</span></p>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1946]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u2022</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Social history</span></span></div>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1947]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 54pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: #2F5496; font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>School </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: #2F5496; font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Absenteeism</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: #2F5496; font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>, bullying, self-confidence, relationships</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1948]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 54pt\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1949]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 54pt\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1950]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><u><strong>Examination:</strong></u></span></p>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1951]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u2022</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Not routinely carried out.</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1952]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u2022</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Needed if effects of bleeding are suspected like anemia.</span></span></div>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1953]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><u><strong>Investigations:</strong></u></span></p>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1954]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u21e8</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><em><strong>All girls with HMB:</strong></em></span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1955]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 72pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u2022</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>CBC </span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1956]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 72pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u2022</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Coagulation screen</span></span></div>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1957]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 72pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Fibrinogen.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1958]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 72pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>PT.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1959]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 72pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>APTT.</span></p>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1960]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u21e8</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><em><strong>Who fail to respond Medical Treatment or Pathology is suspected?</strong></em></span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1961]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 54pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">1.</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>TSH \u2013 if suspicion of hypothyroidism.</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1962]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 54pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">2.</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Prolactin</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1963]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 54pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">3.</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>SHBG, free androgen index \u2013 if PCOS suspected.</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1964]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 54pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">4.</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Pregnancy Test</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1965]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 54pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">5.</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>STI screen</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1966]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 54pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">6.</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Abdominal USG \u2013 to detect uterine anomalies or pelvic mass.</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1967]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 54pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">7.</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>VWD screen \u2013 If suspected.</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1968]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 54pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">8.</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Factor VIII levels \u2013 if suspected.</span></span></div>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1969]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1970]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1971]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1972]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1973]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1974]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1975]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 10pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: #44546A; font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 9pt'><em>Table </em></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: #44546A; font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 9pt'><em>4</em></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: #44546A; font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 9pt'><em>. Treatment</em></span></p>\n<figure class=\"mm-figure\" data-mm-figure-id=\"4fb55a1b28cef132f573c6ef\" data-mm-topic-id=\"t-mm-01-023\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Source figure 4fb55a1b28cef132f573c6ef\" viewbox=\"-9525 -9525 5962650 7677150\" preserveaspectratio=\"xMidYMid meet\" data-mm-object-manifest=\"c897bede8703469a2f54b22e6e47aec3440c5f54cbe8c85c9de2e4b86ea1c374\"><defs><clippath id=\"clip-1cc0d8a165023c68951d\" clippathunits=\"userSpaceOnUse\"><path d=\"M 0 0 L 5943600 0 L 5943600 7657116 L 0 7657116 Z\"></path></clippath></defs><g data-mm-object-id=\"1cc0d8a165023c68951d\" transform=\"translate(0 0)\"><g transform=\"translate(0 0)\" clip-path=\"url(#clip-1cc0d8a165023c68951d)\"><image href=\"/uploads/content-images/maternal-mind-book/f94027611ab71565c9dfd689046bb4a24db921b97ef1453416d5acfa140ed605/media/f2990fd0d67ead81cb7b23d4df99ab3276345a26e8d2a71566f648799610cb7e.jfif\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"5943600\" height=\"7657116\" preserveaspectratio=\"none\"></image><path d=\"M 0 0 L 5943600 0 L 5943600 7657116 L 0 7657116 Z\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-opacity=\"1\" stroke-width=\"12700\"></path></g></g></svg></figure>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1977]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt\">\u00a0</p>\n<figure class=\"mm-figure\" data-mm-figure-id=\"e4d7f9dd350ae91ac520124e\" data-mm-topic-id=\"t-mm-01-023\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Source figure e4d7f9dd350ae91ac520124e\" viewbox=\"-9525 -9525 5962650 6896100\" preserveaspectratio=\"xMidYMid meet\" data-mm-object-manifest=\"25e396e2bb51d235d5dcb23cd78e7b5ac0265bc332465a03e08bf1f5a51e3ce3\"><defs><clippath id=\"clip-19f39011efc93fe2fa3b\" clippathunits=\"userSpaceOnUse\"><path d=\"M 0 0 L 5943600 0 L 5943600 6875647 L 0 6875647 Z\"></path></clippath></defs><g data-mm-object-id=\"19f39011efc93fe2fa3b\" transform=\"translate(0 0)\"><g 